        "x": 536,
        "y": 443
      },
      "action": 3440364824,
      "lines": [
        "More contains checking and run entry. Free",
        "accepts your choices without warnings.",
        "Guided names a row or column whose",
        "clues no longer fit."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "Text",
      "x": 47,
      "y": 583,
      "width": 978,
      "height": 192,
      "centre": {
        "x": 536,
        "y": 679
      },
      "action": 3440364824,
      "lines": [
        "Run entry fills a horizontal or vertical run",
        "between two taps. Undo reverses the whole",
        "run, a single mark or a confirmed restart."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "Text",
      "x": 47,
      "y": 787,
      "width": 978,
      "height": 256,
      "centre": {
        "x": 536,
        "y": 915
      },
      "action": 3440364824,
      "lines": [
        "Mark every square, including empty",
        "squares with a cross, to finish. The",
        "completed picture opens when all marks",
        "match."
      ]
    },
